      "body": "## First exploration\r\n- Add newsletter to footer so it's visible across all site pages rather than just being displayed on our blog page [here](https://snapcraft.io/blog)\r\n- @therealjuan @evandandrea let me know your thoughts 😉 \r\n\r\n### 001\r\n![001-subscribe-newsletter](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17748020/56725139-3409b800-6744-11e9-89d2-8ff033322770.png)\r\n\r\n### 002\r\n![002-subscribe-newsletter](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17748020/56725140-3409b800-6744-11e9-9a84-916000c7245e.png)\r\n\r\n### 003\r\n![003-subscribe-newsletter](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17748020/56725141-3409b800-6744-11e9-8135-cdd044e427ea.png)\r\n\r\n### 004\r\n![004-subscribe-newsletter](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17748020/56725143-3409b800-6744-11e9-9731-6a8abb649ec9.png)\r\n",
