      "body": "## Design review\r\nFull meeting notes can be found here: https://github.com/canonical-web-and-design/meeting-notes/issues/386\r\n\r\n- Can we hide the subscribe form? Keep it simple with a button or link that opens the form\r\n- Links should live together, _Legal should live together_, _Sign-up should live together_, _Social should live together_?\r\n- 'We're hiring!' should be 'Careers' so it's consistent with the rest of our suite of sites\r\n- 001 layout preferred \r\n- Good use of white space\r\n- Keep Vanilla 'Back to top' link",
      "author_association": "NONE",
      "pin": null,
